{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20824","headline":"始爲奉礼忆昌谷山居 · 李贺","name":"始爲奉礼忆昌谷山居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"扫断马蹄痕，衙回自闭门。\n长枪江米熟，小树枣花春。\n向壁悬如意，当帘阅角巾。\n犬书曾去洛，鹤病悔游秦。\n土甑封茶叶，山盃锁竹根。\n不知船上月，谁櫂满溪云。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李贺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}